Task 1: Configure Ingress Gateway with Routing Rules
Subtask 1.1: Verify Service Mesh Installation
First, let's verify that the service mesh is properly installed and running.

Check the service mesh control plane status:
oc get pods -n istio-system
Verify the ingress gateway deployment:
oc get pods -n istio-system -l app=istio-ingressgateway
Check the ingress gateway service:
oc get svc -n istio-system istio-ingressgateway
Expected output should show the ingress gateway pod running and the service with external IP or LoadBalancer type.

Subtask 1.2: Deploy Sample Application
